       |  |  +---w on-path-positioning?   enumeration
       |  |  +---w path-symmetry?         boolean
       |  |  +---w preferred-sites*       string
       |  +---w global-restriction
       |  |  +---w site-restriction
       |  |  |  +---w site* [site-id]
       |  |  |     +---w site-id               string
       |  |  |     +---w restriction-type?     restriction-type
       |  |  |     +---w restriction-scopes*   restriction-scope
       |  |  +---w node-restriction
