       |  |  |     +---w node-id               org-openroadm-common-node-types:node-id-type
       |  |  |     +---w restriction-type?     restriction-type
       |  |  |     +---w restriction-scopes*   restriction-scope
       |  |  +---w regeneration-site-restriction
       |  |  |  +---w forbidden-site* [site-id]
       |  |  |     +---w site-id                          string
       |  |  |     +---w regeneration-restriction-type?   regeneration-restriction-type
       |  |  |     +---w restriction-scopes*              restriction-scope
       |  |  +---w regeneration-node-restriction
